OL,3,ABritish woman rescued in Malawi
OL,4,Ashootout that left four suspected
OL,5,Akidnappers dead
OL,6,
OL,7,FA British woman who was kidnapped in
OL,8,FMalawi nearly a week ago has been
OL,9,Frescued in a police operation that left
OL,10,Ffour suspected kidnappers dead and a
OL,11,Fsenior police chief wounded.
OL,13,FNusrat Osman, 47, was freed on Thursday
OL,14,Fduring an operation on the outskirts of
OL,15,Fthe southern city of Blantyre, police
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FOfficers exchanged gunfire with the
OL,19,Fsuspected kidnappers, who police said
OL,20,Fwere armed with an AK-47 rifle and a
OL,21,Fpistol.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
