OL,4,Ashootout that left four suspected
OL,5,Akidnappers dead
OL,6,
OL,7,F"The criminals got shot and were rushed
OL,8,Fto the hospital where they succumbed to
OL,9,Fthe injuries," the Malawi Police
OL,10,FService said in a statement.
